<h2 id="what-is-aweber">📧 What Is AWeber?</h2>

AWeber is one of the original email marketing platforms, launched in 1998. It's built for small businesses that need straightforward email campaigns, automation sequences, and list management without the learning curve of enterprise platforms.

For med spas, AWeber offers the core functionality you need: automated welcome sequences, appointment reminders, promotional campaigns, and landing pages. The platform handles roughly 1 billion emails monthly and maintains industry-leading deliverability rates—crucial when your Botox promotion needs to land in inboxes, not spam folders.

The 2026 version includes AI-powered content generation, enhanced automation workflows, and improved analytics. AWeber positions itself as the "simple but powerful" option in a crowded market dominated by more complex alternatives like Klaviyo and HubSpot.

